{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"REV","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"启示录","commonName":"启示录","title":"启示录","order":66,"numberOfChapters":22,"sha256":"d51813eeb92e52c116e540460191a340affdfe0ba2e16b4df2e89cff219ae65e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/REV/1.json","lastChapterNumber":22,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/REV/22.json","totalNumberOfVerses":405},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["天上的敬拜"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["此后，我观看，见天上有门开了。我初次听见好像吹号的声音，对我说：「你上到这里来，我要将以后必成的事指示你。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["我立刻被圣灵感动，见有一个宝座安置在天上，又有一位坐在宝座上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["看那坐着的，好像碧玉和红宝石；又有虹围着宝座，好像绿宝石。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["宝座的周围又有二十四个座位；其上坐着二十四位长老，身穿白衣，头上戴着金冠冕。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["有闪电、声音、雷轰从宝座中发出；又有七盏火灯在宝座前点着；这七灯就是 神的七灵。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["宝座前好像一个玻璃海，如同水晶。 宝座中和宝座周围有四个活物，前后遍体都满了眼睛。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["第一个活物像狮子，第二个像牛犊，第三个脸面像人，第四个像飞鹰。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["四活物各有六个翅膀，遍体内外都满了眼睛。他们昼夜不住地说：",{"text":"圣哉！圣哉！圣哉！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主 神是昔在、今在、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以后永在的全能者。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["每逢四活物将荣耀、尊贵、感谢归给那坐在宝座上、活到永永远远者的时候，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["那二十四位长老就俯伏在坐宝座的面前敬拜那活到永永远远的，又把他们的冠冕放在宝座前，说："]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"我们的主，我们的 神，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你是配得荣耀、尊贵、权柄的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你创造了万物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并且万物是因你的旨意被创造而有的。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/REV/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/REV/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/REV/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}